		<!--about start -->
		<section id="about" class="about">
			<div class="section-heading text-center">
				<h2>about me</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="container">
				<div class="about-content">
					<div class="row">
						<div class="col-sm-6">
							<div class="single-about-txt">
								<h3>
									I am currently working as a Back Office Applications Administrator, where I focus on automating and enhancing internal systems to improve operational efficiency. With a strong background in both software development and enterprise systems, I specialize in building full-stack applications using ASP.NET, ASP.NET Core,REACT WITH POSGRESS,MYSQL and SQL database.
								</h3>
								<p>
									I have successfully developed and implemented several mission-critical systems for my organization, including:
								</p>
								<ul>
									<li>
										<b>Share Management System:</b> Built with ASP.NET and SQL Server to manage shareholder operations.
									</li>
									<li><b>Risk and Compliance Management System:</b> Developed using ASP.NET Core, improving risk tracking and compliance reporting.</li>
								</ul>
								<p>
									In addition, I’ve expanded my skill set into modern JavaScript frameworks by building robust systems using React, Node.js, and SQL-based databases, such as:
									<ul>
										<li>
											<b>Outsourcing Management System:</b> Developed with React, Node.js, and SQL Server for managing outsourced service providers.
										</li>
										<li>
											<b>Agent Banking for Robust Company:</b> Built with React, TypeScript, Node.js, and PostgreSQL to streamline evaluation and performance tracking.


										</li>
										<li>
											<b>Audit Management System:</b>Built with React, Angular, and MYSQL to streamline evaluation and performance tracking.
										</li>
									</ul>
								</p>
								<p>
									Driven by a passion for solving real-world problems with technology, I continue to grow my expertise in full-stack development, enterprise applications, and system automation.
								</p>
